{"source":"PLD-050 General Denial.pdf","faces":[["ArialMT","sans-serif"],["Arial-BoldMT","sans-serif"],["Arial-ItalicMT","sans-serif"],["Arial-BoldItalicMT","sans-serif"]],"pages":[{"n":1,"form":"PLD-050","keys":["pid050"],"rev":"january12024","w":612,"h":792,"items":[["Form Adopted for Mandatory Use",36,733.14,89.03,6,0,0],["Judicial Council of California",36,740.34,75.35,6,0,0],["PLD-050 [Rev. January 1, 2024]",36,747.54,85.71,6,0,0],["GENERAL DENIAL",261.55,734.45,88.89,10,1,0],["Code of Civil Procedure, §§ 431.30, 431.40",460.93,733.14,115.06,6,0,0],["www.courts.ca.gov",524.23,741.5,50.35,6,2,0],["PLD-050",535.99,34.02,40.01,10,1,0],["FOR COURT USE ONLY",451.47,51.6,68,6,3,0],["CASE NUMBER:",400.01,233.21,45.67,6,0,0],["ATTORNEY OR PARTY WITHOUT ATTORNEY",37.59,47.73,129.01,6,0,0],["STATE BAR NUMBER:",243.82,49.23,62.68,6,0,0],["NAME:",37.59,60.8,19,6,0,0],["FIRM NAME:",37.59,72.38,35.33,6,0,0],["STREET ADDRESS:",37.59,83.94,56.01,6,0,0],["CITY:",37.59,95.51,15.34,6,0,0],["STATE:",242.27,95.51,21.01,6,0,0],["ZIP CODE:",296.47,95.51,30.01,6,0,0],["TELEPHONE NO.:",37.59,107.08,50.35,6,0,0],["FAX NO.:",239.07,107.08,25.67,6,0,0],["EMAIL ADDRESS:",37.59,118.65,50.35,6,0,0],["ATTORNEY FOR",37.59,130.23,47,6,0,0],["(name):",86.26,130.23,20.67,6,2,0],["SUPERIOR COURT OF CALIFORNIA, COUNTY OF",37.59,143.79,188.9,8,1,0],["STREET ADDRESS:",40.98,156.15,56.01,6,0,0],["MAILING ADDRESS:",39.97,167.08,57.01,6,0,0],["CITY AND ZIP CODE:",37.59,178.08,59.68,6,0,0],["BRANCH NAME:",50.99,189.7,46,6,0,0],["PLAINTIFF/PETITIONER:",59.12,203.1,92.46,8,0,0],["DEFENDANT/RESPONDENT:",42.66,216.5,108.9,8,0,0],["GENERAL DENIAL",144.4,235.42,106.67,12,1,0],["If you want to file a general denial, you MUST use this form if the amount asked for in the complaint or the value of the property",43.2,264.92,505.24,9,0,0],["involved is $1,000 or less.",43.2,275.72,103.55,9,0,0],["You MAY use this form for a general denial if",43.2,286.52,178.58,9,0,0],["1. The complaint is not verified;",55.71,297.32,124.55,9,0,0],["or",182.76,297.32,9,9,3,0],["2. The complaint is verified and the case is a limited civil case (the amount in controversy is $35,000 or less),",55.71,308.12,432.67,9,0,0],["BUT NOT if the complaint involves a claim for more than $1,000 that has been assigned to a third party for collection.",53.21,318.92,465.7,9,0,0],["(See Code of Civil Procedure sections 85–86, 90–100, 431.30, and 431.40.)",43.2,340.52,302.67,9,0,0],["1.",36,361.18,7.51,9,0,0],["DEFENDANT (",50.71,361.49,60.5,9,0,0],["name):",111.2,361.49,28.01,9,2,0],["generally denies each and every allegation of plaintiff's complaint.",50.71,371.53,261.34,9,0,0],["2.",36,384.08,7.51,9,0,0],["DEFENDANT states the following FACTS as separate affirmative defenses to plaintiff's complaint",74.05,384.1,386.86,9,0,0],["(attach additional",463.43,384.1,68.54,9,2,0],["pages if necessary):",74.05,394.93,80.53,9,2,0],["Date:",36,579.17,21.51,9,0,0],["(TYPE OR PRINT NAME)",127.61,616.96,69.01,6,0,0],["(SIGNATURE OF DEFENDANT OR ATTORNEY)",380.71,616.22,132.34,6,0,0],["If you have a claim for damages or other relief against the plaintiff, the law may require you to state your claim in a special pleading",41.76,629,520.73,9,0,0],["called a cross-complaint or you may lose your right to bring the claim. (See Code of Civil Procedure sections 426.10–426.40.)",41.76,639.8,498.7,9,0,0],["The original of this",41.76,661.43,73.53,9,0,0],["General Denial",117.8,661.43,60.02,9,2,0],["must be filed with the clerk of this court with proof that a copy was served on each plaintiff's",180.33,661.43,362.88,9,0,0],["attorney and on each plaintiff not represented by an attorney. There are two main ways to serve this",41.76,672.25,397.2,9,0,0],["General Denial",441.49,672.25,60.02,9,2,0],[": by personal",501.52,672.25,51.52,9,0,0],["delivery or by mail. It may be served by anyone at least 18 years of age EXCEPT you or any other party to this legal action. Be sure",41.76,683.05,523.24,9,0,0],["that whoever serves the",41.76,693.88,95.54,9,0,0],["General Denial",139.81,693.88,60.02,9,2,0],["fills out and signs a proof of service. You may use the applicable Judicial Council form (such",202.35,693.88,366.15,9,0,0],["as form POS-020, POS-030, or POS-040) for the proof of service.",41.76,704.68,261.61,9,0,0],["Page 1 of 1",544.32,720.98,31.68,6,1,0]],"fields":[[400.01,241.08,572.8,255.47,9,0],[308.83,49,393.99,58,9,0],[57.55,60.57,393.99,69.57,9,0],[73.67,72.14,393.99,81.14,9,0],[95.56,83.71,393.99,92.71,9,0],[54.34,95.27,240.41,104.27,9,0],[263.52,95.27,293.67,104.27,9,0],[326.75,95.27,393.99,104.27,9,0],[89.77,106.84,216.83,115.84,9,0],[266.11,106.84,393.99,115.84,9,0],[91.06,118.41,393.99,127.41,9,0],[107.81,129.98,393.99,138.98,9,0],[227.71,144.97,393.99,153.97,8,1],[96.99,155.91,393.99,164.91,9,0],[96.99,166.85,393.99,175.85,9,0],[96.99,177.84,393.98,186.84,9,0],[96.99,189.46,393.99,198.46,9,0],[151.56,204.28,394.34,213.28,8,0],[151.56,217.54,394.34,226.84,8,0],[141.09,363.36,573.27,372.39,9,0],[73.43,407.66,572.33,573.75,9,0],[61.2,580.56,169.2,590.56,9,0],[36,601.1,288.22,615.21,9,0]],"boxes":[[55.04,385.97,64.04,394.97]]}]}